{"design":{"context":"视频暂停后，根据已审核文字中的传球关系启动独立小游戏：红衣女性的来球沿虚拟轨迹接近蓝衣男性，蓝衣男性通过合拢双手完成接球。双手合拢区、来球和反馈均为新增自绘游戏元素，不读取、追踪或判定真实人物像素，也不依赖原片人物继续运动。","goal":"玩家把握篮球进入双手合拢区的短暂时机，按下“合拢双手”，使虚拟双手恰好包住篮球并完成接球。","screen":"透明背景中央放置一块半透明操作面板。上方显示“精准接球时机”和当前状态；中部是一条从左向右延伸的虚拟传球轨迹，绿色竖向区域代表双手合拢区，橙色篮球标记从左端接近该区域；区域下方显示时机提示、较大的“合拢双手”按钮和结果文案。所有元素均相对容器自适应排列。","input":"准备阶段按钮暂时禁用。进行阶段，鼠标或触屏在按钮上触发 pointerdown 时立即按当前来球进度判定；键盘 Enter 或空格执行相同判定。pointercancel 到达时，若此前已发生 pointerdown，则不撤销已经提交的判定，也不重复结算。点击按钮以外的区域没有效果；首次有效判定后按钮禁用，后续输入不再产生第二次结果。","rules":"准备时间为 0.35 秒。随后篮球进度在 2.8 秒内从 0 匀速增加到 1，并以容器横向 0%–100% 的归一化位置显示，不使用厘米或真实空间坐标。双手合拢区为进度 78%–86%，对应进行阶段约 2.184–2.408 秒。首次有效按下时，进度小于 78% 为过早并失败；进度大于等于 78% 且小于等于 86% 为成功，两个边界均包含；进度大于 86% 为过晚并失败。即使篮球已经飞过，仍在总时限内按下也按过晚失败。总时限为挂载后 5 秒，超时未完成有效判定则失败。准备阶段、按钮外点击以及判定后的重复操作均不计为过早操作。","states":"准备→进行→成功/失败→结束。准备阶段显示来球提示并禁用按钮；进行阶段篮球持续接近合拢区；首次有效输入后立即锁定为成功或失败，播放对应动画，约 0.6 秒后调用一次 api.finish；宿主显示 1 秒反馈并结束小游戏、恢复原片。","feedback":"成功时篮球移入绿色双手区，双手合拢并呈自然持球过渡，状态显示“接球成功”，提交文案为“稳稳接住！双手已合拢。”。过早时篮球在当前位置向上弹开并轻微回落，状态显示“接球失败”，提交文案为“太早了：篮球尚未进入双手范围。”；过晚或超时时篮球向右上飞出，失败操作伴随程序生成的轻微失误音，过晚文案为“太晚了：篮球已经越过接球区。”，超时文案为“超时：未在接球窗口内合拢双手。”。结束反馈的 1 秒展示和原片恢复由宿主处理，不产生剧情分支。","timeout_s":5},"javascript":"function mount(container, api) {
  'use strict';
  if (!container || !api || typeof api.finish !== 'function') {
    if (api && typeof api.reportError === 'function') api.reportError('mount 需要有效的 container 与 api.finish');
    throw new Error('Invalid mount arguments');
  }

  const PREPARE_MS = 350;
  const TRAVEL_MS = 2800;
  const TOTAL_MS = 5000;
  const CATCH_START = 0.78;
  const CATCH_END = 0.86;
  const CATCH_MIDDLE = (CATCH_START + CATCH_END) / 2;

  let state = 'prepare';
  let activeStart = 0;
  let rafId = 0;
  let prepareTimer = 0;
  let timeoutTimer = 0;
  let finishTimer = 0;
  let finishCalled = false;
  let destroyed = false;
  let audioContext = null;

  const root = document.createElement('div');
  root.id = 'game';
  root.setAttribute('role', 'application');
  root.setAttribute('aria-label', '精准接球时机小游戏');

  const panel = make('div', 'panel');
  const header = make('div', 'header');
  const title = make('h2', 'title', '精准接球时机');
  const status = make('div', 'status', '准备接球…');
  status.setAttribute('aria-live', 'polite');
  header.append(title, status);

  const trajectory = make('div', 'trajectory');
  trajectory.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'true');
  const route = make('div', 'route');
  const zone = make('div', 'catch-zone');
  zone.style.left = (CATCH_START * 100) + '%';
  zone.style.width = ((CATCH_END - CATCH_START) * 100) + '%';
  const hands = make('div', 'hands');
  hands.style.left = (CATCH_START * 100) + '%';
  hands.style.width = ((CATCH_END - CATCH_START) * 100) + '%';
  const ball = make('div', 'ball');
  ball.style.left = '0%';
  trajectory.append(route, zone, hands, ball);

  const labels = make('div', 'labels');
  labels.append(make('span', 'ball-label', '来球'), make('span', 'zone-label', '双手合拢区'));
  const hint = make('div', 'hint', '篮球进入绿色区域时，立即合拢双手');
  const button = make('button', 'action', '合拢双手');
  button.type = 'button';
  button.disabled = true;
  const resultText = make('div', 'result', '等待你把握接球时机');
  resultText.setAttribute('aria-live', 'assertive');
  panel.append(header, trajectory, labels, hint, button, resultText);
  root.append(panel);
  container.appendChild(root);

  function make(tag, className, text) {
    const node = document.createElement(tag);
    if (className) node.className = className;
    if (text !== undefined) node.textContent = text;
    return node;
  }

  function reportError(error) {
    if (!api || typeof api.reportError !== 'function') return;
    const message = error && error.message ? error.message : String(error);
    try {
      api.reportError('接球小游戏运行错误：' + message);
    } catch (_) {
      // 宿主未提供可用错误通道时保持静默，避免影响原片。
    }
  }

  function currentProgress(now) {
    if (!activeStart) return 0;
    return Math.max(0, Math.min(1, (now - activeStart) / TRAVEL_MS));
  }

  function playMissSound() {
    try {
      const AudioConstructor = window.AudioContext || window.webkitAudioContext;
      if (!AudioConstructor) return;
      if (!audioContext) audioContext = new AudioConstructor();
      if (audioContext.state === 'suspended' && typeof audioContext.resume === 'function') {
        audioContext.resume().catch(() => {});
      }
      const oscillator = audioContext.createOscillator();
      const gain = audioContext.createGain();
      const now = audioContext.currentTime;
      oscillator.type = 'triangle';
      oscillator.frequency.setValueAtTime(180, now);
      oscillator.frequency.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(90, now + 0.16);
      gain.gain.setValueAtTime(0.0001, now);
      gain.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.08, now + 0.015);
      gain.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.0001, now + 0.18);
      oscillator.connect(gain);
      gain.connect(audioContext.destination);
      oscillator.start(now);
      oscillator.stop(now + 0.19);
    } catch (_) {
      // 音频不可用时保留完整视觉反馈。
    }
  }

  function conclude(result, message, kind, progress) {
    if (state !== 'playing') return;
    state = result;
    button.disabled = true;
    cancelAnimationFrame(rafId);
    clearTimeout(timeoutTimer);

    if (result === 'success') {
      root.classList.add('success');
      ball.style.left = (CATCH_MIDDLE * 100) + '%';
      status.textContent = '接球成功';
    } else {
      root.classList.add('failure', kind);
      ball.style.left = (Math.max(0, Math.min(1, progress)) * 100) + '%';
      status.textContent = '接球失败';
      playMissSound();
    }
    resultText.textContent = message;

    finishTimer = setTimeout(() => {
      if (destroyed || finishCalled) return;
      finishCalled = true;
      state = 'ended';
      try {
        api.finish({ result: result, message: message });
      } catch (error) {
        reportError(error);
      }
    }, 600);
  }

  function resolveTiming() {
    if (state !== 'playing') return;
    const progress = currentProgress(performance.now());
    if (progress < CATCH_START) {
      conclude('failure', '太早了：篮球尚未进入双手范围。', 'miss-early', progress);
    } else if (progress <= CATCH_END) {
      conclude('success', '稳稳接住！双手已合拢。', 'success', progress);
    } else {
      conclude('failure', '太晚了：篮球已经越过接球区。', 'miss-late', progress);
    }
  }

  function frame(now) {
    if (state !== 'playing') return;
    try {
      const progress = currentProgress(now);
      ball.style.left = (progress * 100) + '%';
      if (progress >= 1) {
        trajectory.classList.add('passed');
        status.textContent = '篮球已经飞过接球区';
      } else if (progress > CATCH_END) {
        status.textContent = '即将错过接球区！';
      } else if (progress >= CATCH_START) {
        status.textContent = '现在合拢双手！';
      } else {
        status.textContent = '篮球正在传来';
      }
      rafId = requestAnimationFrame(frame);
    } catch (error) {
      reportError(error);
      conclude('failure', '小游戏发生异常，请重试。', 'error', currentProgress(now));
    }
  }

  function onPointerDown(event) {
    if (event.button !== undefined && event.button !== 0) return;
    event.preventDefault();
    try {
      resolveTiming();
    } catch (error) {
      reportError(error);
    }
  }

  function onPointerCancel(event) {
    event.preventDefault();
    // timing 在 pointerdown 时已经提交；取消事件不能生成第二次判定。
  }

  function onKeyDown(event) {
    if (event.key !== 'Enter' && event.key !== ' ' && event.key !== 'Spacebar') return;
    event.preventDefault();
    if (event.repeat) return;
    try {
      resolveTiming();
    } catch (error) {
      reportError(error);
    }
  }

  button.addEventListener('pointerdown', onPointerDown);
  button.addEventListener('pointercancel', onPointerCancel);
  button.addEventListener('keydown', onKeyDown);

  prepareTimer = setTimeout(() => {
    if (destroyed || state !== 'prepare') return;
    state = 'playing';
    activeStart = performance.now();
    button.disabled = false;
    status.textContent = '篮球正在传来';
    rafId = requestAnimationFrame(frame);
  }, PREPARE_MS);

  timeoutTimer = setTimeout(() => {
    if (destroyed || state !== 'playing') return;
    conclude('failure', '超时：未在接球窗口内合拢双手。', 'timeout', 1);
  }, TOTAL_MS);

  return {
    destroy() {
      if (destroyed) return;
      destroyed = true;
      cancelAnimationFrame(rafId);
      clearTimeout(prepareTimer);
      clearTimeout(timeoutTimer);
      clearTimeout(finishTimer);
      button.removeEventListener('pointerdown', onPointerDown);
      button.removeEventListener('pointercancel', onPointerCancel);
      button.removeEventListener('keydown', onKeyDown);
      if (audioContext && typeof audioContext.close === 'function') {
        audioContext.close().catch(() => {});
      }
      if (root.parentNode === container) container.removeChild(root);
    }
  };
}","css":"#game { width: 100%; height: 100%; min-height: 260px; position: relative; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 12px; color: #fff; background: transparent; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; user-select: none; -webkit-user-select: none; }
#game * { box-sizing: border-box; }
#game .panel { width: min(760px, 100%); max-height: 100%; padding: clamp(14px, 3vw, 26px); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2); border-radius: 20px; background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(10,25,48,.86), rgba(17,38,66,.68)); box-shadow: 0 16px 45px rgba(0,0,0,.28); backdrop-filter: blur(8px); }
#game .header { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: clamp(12px, 3vh, 24px); }
#game .title { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(20px, 4vw, 30px); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .04em; }
#game .status { color: #cfe8ff; font-size: clamp(13px, 2.2vw, 17px); text-align: right; }
#game .trajectory { position: relative; width: 100%; height: clamp(100px, 22vh, 160px); overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12); border-radius: 16px; background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,.07), rgba(0,0,0,.16)); }
#game .route { position: absolute; z-index: 1; left: 5%; right: 5%; top: 50%; height: 5px; transform: translateY(-50%); border-radius: 999px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,.18), rgba(255,255,255,.08)); box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.05); }
#game .catch-zone { position: absolute; z-index: 2; top: 10%; bottom: 10%; border: 2px solid #68f0a6; border-radius: 12px; background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(71,224,139,.24), rgba(71,224,139,.08)); box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(83,238,151,.28); }
#game .hands { position: absolute; z-index: 3; top: 20%; bottom: 20%; transform-origin: center; pointer-events: none; }
#game .hands::before, #game .hands::after { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 12%; right: 12%; height: 12px; border-radius: 999px 999px 5px 5px; background: #d9efff; box-shadow: 0 2px 7px rgba(0,0,0,.3); }
#game .hands::before { top: -4px; transform: rotate(-4deg); }
#game .hands::after { bottom: -4px; transform: rotate(4deg); }
#game .ball { position: absolute; z-index: 4; top: 50%; left: 0; width: clamp(34px, 7vw, 48px); aspect-ratio: 1; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); border: 3px solid #6b2d13; border-radius: 50%; background: radial-gradient(circle at 34% 28%, #ffbf69 0 8%, #ed7629 28%, #c84d13 100%); box-shadow: 0 8px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.35); pointer-events: none; }
#game .ball::before, #game .ball::after { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 3px; border: 2px solid rgba(83,35,12,.65); border-radius: 50%; }
#game .ball::before { transform: rotate(38deg) scaleY(.36); }
#game .ball::after { transform: rotate(-38deg) scaleY(.36); }
#game .labels { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 8px; color: rgba(235,246,255,.76); font-size: 12px; }
#game .zone-label { color: #91f7ba; font-weight: 700; }
#game .hint { margin: clamp(12px, 3vh, 22px) 0 12px; color: #eef7ff; font-size: clamp(14px, 2.4vw, 18px); text-align: center; }
#game .action { display: block; width: min(360px, 100%); min-height: 58px; margin: 0 auto; border: 0; border-radius: 15px; color: #10233b; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #8ceaff, #4dc7ef); box-shadow: 0 8px 0 #2486a9, 0 14px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.24); font: inherit; font-size: clamp(18px, 3vw, 23px); font-weight: 800; cursor: pointer; touch-action: manipulation; transition: transform .12s ease, filter .12s ease, opacity .12s ease; }
#game .action:hover:not(:disabled) { filter: brightness(1.08); transform: translateY(-2px); }
#game .action:active:not(:disabled) { transform: translateY(4px); box-shadow: 0 3px 0 #2486a9, 0 8px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.24); }
#game .action:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #fff; outline-offset: 4px; }
#game .action:disabled { cursor: default; opacity: .48; filter: saturate(.5); box-shadow: 0 4px 0 #527382; }
#game .result { min-height: 28px; margin-top: 16px; color: #d8e9f8; font-size: clamp(14px, 2.3vw, 17px); font-weight: 700; text-align: center; }
#game.success .status, #game.success .result { color: #8ff5b6; }
#game.failure .status, #game.failure .result { color: #ffb1a8; }
#game.success .catch-zone { background: rgba(71,224,139,.4); box-shadow: 0 0 26px rgba(83,238,151,.55); }
#game.success .ball { animation: game-ball-catch .55s ease-out both; }
#game.success .hands { animation: game-hands-close .45s ease-out both; }
#game.failure.miss-early .ball { animation: game-ball-miss-early .58s ease-out both; }
#game.failure.miss-late .ball, #game.failure.timeout .ball { animation: game-ball-miss-late .58s ease-out both; }
#game.failure .hands { animation: game-hands-open .42s ease-out both; }
#game .trajectory.passed .route { opacity: .45; }
@keyframes game-ball-catch { 0% { transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(.72) rotate(-35deg); } 55% { transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1.14) rotate(10deg); } 100% { transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(.9) rotate(0deg); } }
@keyframes game-ball-miss-early { 0% { transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1) rotate(0); opacity: 1; } 45% { transform: translate(-50%, -165%) scale(1.05) rotate(120deg); opacity: 1; } 100% { transform: translate(-50%, 18%) scale(.72) rotate(250deg); opacity: .28; } }
@keyframes game-ball-miss-late { 0% { transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1) rotate(0); opacity: 1; } 100% { transform: translate(38%, -185%) scale(.68) rotate(190deg); opacity: 0; } }
@keyframes game-hands-close { 0% { transform: scaleY(1.45); } 65% { transform: scaleY(.48); } 100% { transform: scaleY(.64); } }
@keyframes game-hands-open { 0% { transform: scaleY(.65); } 100% { transform: scaleY(1.55); } }
@media (max-width: 520px) { #game { padding: 8px; } #game .panel { padding: 14px; border-radius: 16px; } #game .header { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; } #game .status { text-align: left; } #game .trajectory { height: 98px; } #game .action { min-height: 54px; } }
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { #game .ball, #game .hands { animation-duration: .01ms !important; } #game .action { transition: none; } }"}

